  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞美食广场……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_140.bf.json:0:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_000",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞伙伴们似乎聊得很热闹……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_140.bf.json:1:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 03 01 02 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 86 09 01 07 01 02 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 72 06}这样啊，也就是说，\n埃癸斯每天都会来叫你起床呢。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_140.bf.json:2:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 03 01 0D 01 04 01 01 01}{F1 25}{F5 C1 12 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}　\n{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0C 02}……啊，嗯，是这样。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_140.bf.json:3:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0A 01 0F 01 03 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 00 06}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}真让人羡慕得可恨熊！\n小熊也想被这么可爱的声音叫醒，\n不想听阳介的声音熊！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_140.bf.json:4:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 10 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 7A 0B}协助起床也是我的重要任务。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_140.bf.json:4:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}最近，还为我装上了\n逐步增强闹铃的新功能。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_140.bf.json:5:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 01 01 03 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}增强闹铃？\n具体会是什么样呢？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_140.bf.json:6:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 03 01 02 01 01 01 01 01}{F1 25}{F5 C1 12 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}　\n{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}啊……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_140.bf.json:6:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 03 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 E2 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}埃癸斯，你的好意我心领了，\n不过，能不能别用枪呢？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_140.bf.json:7:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 10 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}美鹤下令，就算死也要叫醒您。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_140.bf.json:8:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0A 01 0B 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 25 07}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}咦？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_140.bf.json:9:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 07 01 01 01 07 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 3E 06}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}死了就醒不过来了吧……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_140.bf.json:10:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_010",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 10 01 03 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 7B 0B}没有问题。\n精密射击是我最擅长的领域。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_140.bf.json:10:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_010",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 10 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}即使出现意外情况，\n威力也已经调整为\n在距离死亡仅一步之处停下。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_140.bf.json:11:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_011",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}只有一步熊？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_140.bf.json:12:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_012",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 02 01 02 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 86 03 01 0D 01 01 01 04 01}{F1 25}{F5 C1 12 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}　\n{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 04 02}你愿意的话……借给你试试？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_140.bf.json:13:0",
  "message_id": "SEL_013",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 02 01 02 01 01 01 01 01}还是算了{F5 47 02 01 02 01 0B 01 21 01}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_140.bf.json:13:1",
  "message_id": "SEL_013",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}我想试试{F5 47 02 01 02 01 01 01 21 01}{00}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_140.bf.json:14:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_014",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 10 01 01 01 07 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 BE 0B}不用客气！\n请务必亲身体验\n我的起床炮！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_140.bf.json:15:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_015",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 09 01 11 01 02 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}起床炮……\n别说起床了，恐怕根本睡不着吧……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_140.bf.json:16:0",
